  "During an active 30-day evaluation trial, every feature set is available — including the production stages and the optimization engine. When the trial ends, the normal edition restrictions apply and the application moves to read-only rather than locking you away from your records.",
  "DXF · .OPT · .ISO · .DAT",
  "Each business area keeps its own data boundary, which limits the damage when something goes wrong. The invoice database cannot corrupt the stock database.",
  "Each card names where in the source tree the behaviour is defined, so a claim can be checked rather than believed. These are counts of what the repository contains — modules, locales, databases and tests. They are not performance claims, and the application makes none.",
  "Each document ends with the work that was not done and why — sometimes because it needs a decision from the shop owner, not a patch. Nothing is quietly dropped.",
  "Each document is raised from the one before it rather than retyped. The number format is the application's own — the year is taken from the machine the data was seeded on, so 2026 here is an example of that year, not a fixed part of the format.",
  "Each entry says where the work currently stands and what would change if somebody took it on. Where the work maps to the codebase, the file is named so it can be read before anything is offered.",
  "Each group below lists the specific behaviours it covers. The evidence line names the part of the source tree that backs it.",
  "Each guide explains the concept, then says what the application does about it — separately, so you can read the explanation whether or not you ever use the software.",
  "Each next delivery note is created from the remaining balance",
  "Each Step 5 specification stays separate — its own base rate, its own surcharge, its own rows at {SURCHARGE_THRESHOLD_SQM} m² and",
