  "Estimating glass",
  "Estimating glass means holding a lot of small numbers in your head at once: a size, a thickness, a build-up, a rate, a wastage allowance, a delivery charge. None of them are difficult on their own. All of them together, every day, on paper, is where mistakes come from.",
