  "The job in one paragraph",
  "The job was repetitive, and the repetition was the problem.",
  "The layout of this module, with its own tabs.",
  "The left column is how a glass job is usually run on paper and in spreadsheets. The right column is what this application does for that same step. Both columns describe the step honestly — there is no time saved or percentage gained in this table, because nothing in the software measures either.",
  "The left-hand descriptions are general practice, not a claim about any particular business, and no figures are quoted for it. The right-hand column is limited to behaviour that exists in the application.",
  "The licence file",
  "The licence page covers what a licence key unlocks and what the free tier includes. If you would rather",
  "The link may be out of date, or the page may never have existed. Everything on this site is reachable from the navigation — here are the pages people usually want.",
