  "The report the whole product exists for",
  "The request arrives with its scope of supply: the project, the site, the salesman who took it and an indicative value of AED 87,450 recorded before anything was priced.",
  "The requested note could not be found.",
  "The rest of the site is fine — this was a failure inside one page, not a problem with your connection. Retrying usually clears it, because the cause is often a value that arrived in a shape the page did not expect.",
  "The rule this page keeps",
  "The run records a weak lower bound on the sheet count (area only) and reports the optimality gap — so 'how close was this?' has an answer instead of a claim.",
  "The run the result belongs to.",
  "The sales representative is carried on the inquiry and the proforma, so performance is measured from the documents themselves rather than from a separate tally. Value, conversion and profitability sit on the same row.",
  "The same data, six times",
  "The same flow, seen as one board from Cutting to Dispatch-ready.",
  "The same four-step generator pattern as the order report, over the customer's invoices: what was issued, what is outstanding, what is overdue and an ageing analysis — with an optional combined PDF that merges the signed documents into the same file.",
  "The same glass gets typed five times, and the fifth number never matches the first.",
  "The same glass, typed again",
  "The same inputs produce the same number every time, with no hidden state. If two screens show a figure, both came from the same computation.",
  "The same job, worked two ways.",
  "The same receivables picture, grouped by the issuing company instead.",
